MKCKKS Go2Py contains two separately licensed bodies of work.

The directories cnn/, mkbfv/, mkckks/, and mkrlwe/, and the upstream module
metadata in go.mod, are vendored without functional modification from
SNUCP/MKHE-KKLSS commit 13fed55fd28270fb4345dd532da24b323ebc5ce3 and are
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 2.0.

