Group and contributors and are licensed under the MIT License.

Python-wrapper publication:
Abdullah Al Omar, Xin Yang, Euijin Choo, and Omid Ardakanian,
"MASER: Efficient Privacy-Preserving Cross-Silo Federated Learning with
Multi-Key Homomorphic Encryption," 2025 IEEE International Conference on Big
Data (BigData), pp. 3472-3481, 2025.
https://doi.org/10.1109/BIGDATA66926.2025.11401805

Underlying implementation: https://github.com/SNUCP/MKHE-KKLSS
Underlying algorithm paper: https://eprint.iacr.org/2022/347

The combined distribution is source-available for noncommercial research. It
is not currently an OSI-approved open-source distribution and has not been
independently audited for production cryptographic use.
